            "primer": "Direct students to paragraphs [5.1]–[5.2] and Source C. Contrast Robert Hooke’s Micrographia and Leeuwenhoek’s discovery of \"animalcules\" with the persistent reliance on bloodletting, purging, and miasma, proving that scientific observation outpaced clinical therapy.",
            "question": "Why did Antonie van Leeuwenhoek’s discovery of microscopic bacteria fail to save a single human life in the seventeenth century?"
