          "Source B": "The frontispiece of Volume I of Philosophical Transactions (1665), the world’s first peer-reviewed scientific journal, published under the authority of the Royal Society of London. **Hinge Question:** Why was international peer review essential for establishing the credibility of new empirical discoveries over ancient classical authority?",
