          "type": "two_sided_argument",
          "topic": "Scientific Communication vs Everyday Medical Beliefs",
          "question": "‘The creation of the Royal Society was more important than the invention of the printing press in advancing medical ideas in the Renaissance.’ How far do you agree? Explain your answer [16+4 marks].",
          "text": "Scientific Communication vs Everyday Medical Beliefs: Advancement vs Limitations",
