            "primer": "Direct students to paragraphs [5.1]–[5.2]. Explore how microscopic capillaries completed the circuit, and why bloodletting continued for two centuries despite Harvey.",
            "question": "Why did understanding that blood circulated in a closed loop fail to improve medical treatments during the Renaissance?"
