              "text": "Every visited house shall be shut up with a red cross of a foot long painted on the middle of the door, with these words: \"Lord have mercy upon us\", there to continue until forty days after the infection hath ceased. Two watchmen shall be appointed to every infected house, one by day and the other by night, who shall strictly prevent any person from going in or coming forth upon pain of imprisonment. All dogs and cats shall be forthwith slaughtered by the dog-killers, lest they carry the pestilence in their fur.",
