            "primer": "Direct students to paragraphs [5.1]–[5.2]. Contrast the dramatic decline in smallpox deaths with the rise of the Anti-Vaccination League, and emphasize that without Germ Theory, Jenner could not adapt vaccination to other diseases.",
            "question": "Why was Jenner unable to use his smallpox breakthrough to create vaccines for other killer diseases like cholera or typhoid?"
