        "primer": "This enquiry evaluates the revolution in Victorian hospital care and nursing, analyzing Florence Nightingale’s sanitary reforms at Scutari during the Crimean War, her statistical advocacy using the Coxcomb chart, the introduction of the cross-ventilated Pavilion Hospital Plan, the professionalization of nursing at St Thomas’ Hospital, and Mary Seacole’s frontline contribution.",
