          "image_alt": "Historical lithograph showing Florence Nightingale carrying her lamp through the wounded soldiers' wards at the Barrack Hospital in Scutari, 1855",
          "caption": "The Pavilion Plan: Hospital ward designed with high ceilings, separate pavilion wings, and large opposing windows to ensure maximum cross-ventilation and prevent foul air accumulation (1860s).",
