          "model_answer": "Source C commemorates Dr Rosalind Franklin, whose rigorous X-ray crystallography produced the crucial experimental data—most notably Photograph 51—that proved DNA had a helical structure with water-attracting phosphate backbones on the outside. Her uncredited data enabled Watson and Crick to construct their correct double helix model.",
