          "content": "<span class=\"para-ref\">[5.1]</span> In 2016, the UK enacted standardized **plain packaging**, replacing colourful branding with graphic medical warning images. Concurrently, medical oncology advanced through CT screening, robotic lobectomies, radiotherapy, and targeted immunotherapies.<br><br><span class=\"para-ref\">[5.2]</span> Yet lung cancer remains deadly, with low five-year survival rates because symptoms manifest late. The fight against lung cancer demonstrates that state legislation, taxation, and lifestyle education save far more lives than advanced clinical cures alone.",
